      "message": "1. We set iommu-\u003eviommu.iqa to vreg-\u003eiqa _before_ initializing vreg-\u003eiqa in initialize_qi()? (Although I see initialize_qi() itself also initializes iommu-\u003eviommu.iqa together with vreg-\u003eiqa, but still, seems unclean.)\n2. We set vreg-\u003eiq_head to 0 and then just overwrite it with the value read from hardware in initialize_qi()? (This seems like an actual bug. At least because this value is gonna be outdated by the time initialize_qi() returns, right?)\n\nSo it seems we should do the following instead:\n```\n\tif (en) {\n\t\tif (!iommu-\u003eqi_enabled)\n\t\t\tinitialize_qi(iommu);\n\t\t\n\t\t/* existing logic */\n\t\t...\n\t}\n```\n\n?",
